WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.667 --> 00:00:16.337
The Land of the Monkeys was very quiet.

2
00:00:16.338 --> 00:00:19.669
Dr. Dolittle could sense the sickness in the air.

3
00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:24.606
All around him were hundreds, no, thousands, of sick monkeys.

4
00:00:24.607 --> 00:00:29.619
Many had already died.

5
00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:33.920
First, Dr. Dolittle separated the sick and the healthy.

6
00:00:33.921 --> 00:00:37.012
Dr. Dolittle's animals helped him.

7
00:00:37.013 --> 00:00:40.271
"Chee-Chee! Build me a hut!" he said.

8
00:00:40.272 --> 00:00:43.617
"Jip! Too-Too! Find the other monkeys in the land!

9
00:00:43.618 --> 00:00:45.952
Bring them here," he ordered.

10
00:00:45.953 --> 00:00:51.618
"Gub-Gub! Dab-Dab! Help Polynesia find some herbs!"

11
00:00:51.619 --> 00:00:57.168
Then Dr. Dolittle gave shots to the healthy monkeys so they wouldn't get sick.

12
00:00:57.169 --> 00:01:00.674
Meanwhile, the sick ones needed to be cared for.

13
00:01:00.675 --> 00:01:04.169
But there were just too many.

14
00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:10.260
"Doctor, we cannot do this by ourselves," Chee-Chee said tiredly.

15
00:01:10.261 --> 00:01:13.871
"We need help," admitted Polynesia.

16
00:01:13.872 --> 00:01:16.847
Dr. Dolittle thought for a moment.

17
00:01:16.848 --> 00:01:22.011
"Let's send out a message to the other animals in the jungle," he said.

18
00:01:22.012 --> 00:01:29.204
A few days later, the leaders of the lions, leopards, and antelope paid a visit to the doctor.

19
00:01:29.205 --> 00:01:33.295
"The monkeys need your help," Dr. Dolittle explained.

20
00:01:33.296 --> 00:01:39.675
"My help? Ha! I am the king of beasts!" the proud lion roared.

21
00:01:39.676 --> 00:01:41.992
"Monkeys are dirty and smelly!

22
00:01:41.993 --> 00:01:44.092
I wouldn't even eat them!"

23
00:01:44.093 --> 00:01:48.744
With that, the lion turned up his nose and walked away.

24
00:01:48.745 --> 00:01:51.685
The leader of leopards looked at the doctor.

25
00:01:51.686 --> 00:01:55.150
"If the lion king doesn't help, then I won't help!"

26
00:01:55.151 --> 00:01:57.609
He too turned and walked away.

27
00:01:57.610 --> 00:02:01.662
"We feel bad for the monkeys, but we don't know how to help.

28
00:02:01.663 --> 00:02:07.551
I'm sorry." Even the antelope turned away.

29
00:02:07.552 --> 00:02:11.393
At home, the lioness was waiting for her husband.

30
00:02:11.394 --> 00:02:14.750
"One of the cubs is sick!" she cried.

31
00:02:14.751 --> 00:02:19.190
"I heard there is an animal doctor here," his wife continued.

32
00:02:19.191 --> 00:02:23.382
"Yes, I met him," the lion answered proudly.

33
00:02:23.383 --> 00:02:28.064
Then the lion told his wife what he had said to the doctor.

34
00:02:28.065 --> 00:02:30.589
The lioness was very angry.

35
00:02:30.590 --> 00:02:33.735
"Are you out of your mind?" she shouted.

36
00:02:33.736 --> 00:02:36.423
"He is here to help the animal world!"

37
00:02:36.424 --> 00:02:39.316
The proud lion suddenly turned red.

38
00:02:39.317 --> 00:02:43.739
"We need him to help our baby!" his wife roared.

39
00:02:43.740 --> 00:02:47.311
The lioness began pulling her husband's hair.

40
00:02:47.312 --> 00:02:51.768
"OUCH! OUCH!" he cried.

41
00:02:51.769 --> 00:02:56.133
"Go back and tell him you're sorry!" she shouted.

42
00:02:56.134 --> 00:02:59.511
The lion did not want to lose all his hair.

43
00:02:59.512 --> 00:03:03.056
And he did not want his baby to be sick.

44
00:03:03.057 --> 00:03:06.789
And he did not want his wife to be angry with him.

45
00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:10.085
He knew he must help the monkeys.

46
00:03:10.086 --> 00:03:13.944
"Look! Dr. Dolittle!" Jip suddenly barked.

47
00:03:13.945 --> 00:03:16.654
It was the proud leader of the lions.

48
00:03:16.655 --> 00:03:20.309
He brought hundreds of other animals with him.

49
00:03:20.310 --> 00:03:27.785
"Uh, Dr. Dolittle, do you still need my help?" the lion asked.

50
00:03:27.786 --> 00:03:31.563
"Yes, we really do," Dr. Dolittle nodded.

51
00:03:31.564 --> 00:03:36.000
"I am King of the Jungle," the lion said proudly.

52
00:03:36.001 --> 00:03:39.291
"I know," the doctor replied kindly.

53
00:03:39.292 --> 00:03:44.455
"So I commanded the animals to come and help," the lion continued.

54
00:03:44.456 --> 00:03:48.143
"Thank you very much," replied the doctor.

55
00:03:48.144 --> 00:03:52.057
Every day, more and more jungle animals came to help.

56
00:03:52.058 --> 00:03:55.712
With their help, the monkeys got better quickly.

57
00:03:55.713 --> 00:03:59.440
Dr. Dolittle's work was almost done.

58
00:03:59.441 --> 00:04:04.474
Dr. Dolittle made a special visit to the lion's den.

59
00:04:04.475 --> 00:04:08.441
"Is my baby okay?" asked the worried lion.

60
00:04:08.442 --> 00:04:12.201
"He just needs this and he'll be fine."

61
00:04:12.202 --> 00:04:17.248
"Thank you, Dr. Dolittle," the leader of the lions bowed his head.

62
00:04:17.249 --> 00:04:19.293
"No, thank you.

63
00:04:19.294 --> 00:04:29.758
Without your help, the monkeys would have all died," said the doctor.
